{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Daily Quiz": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) a + b = &radic;8, a - b = &radic;5 হলে, 8ab(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>) এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 24", "option2": "খ) 28", "option3": "গ) 39", "option4": "ঘ) 36", "answer": "3", "exp": "দেয়া আছে,<br />a + b = &radic;8, <br />a - b = &radic;5<br /><br />8ab(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>) = 4ab. 2(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>)<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= {(a + b)<sup>2</sup> - (a - b)<sup>2</sup>}{(a + b)<sup>2</sup> + (a - b)<sup>2</sup>}<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= {(&radic;8)<sup>2</sup> - (&radic;5)<sup>2</sup> }{(&radic;8)<sup>2</sup> + (&radic;5)<sup>2</sup> }<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= (8 - 5)(8 + 5)<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 3 &times; 13<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 39&nbsp;"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) a<sup>4</sup> + a<sup>2</sup> + 1 এর উৎপাদক কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) (a<sup>2</sup> + a - 1)(a<sup>2</sup> - a + 1)", "option2": "খ) (a<sup>2</sup> + a + 1)(a<sup>2</sup> - a - 1)", "option3": "গ) (a<sup>2</sup> + a + 1)(a<sup>2</sup> - a + 1)", "option4": "ঘ) (a<sup>2</sup> + a + 1)(a<sup>2</sup> - 2a + 1)", "answer": "3", "exp": "&nbsp; &nbsp; a<sup>4</sup> + a<sup>2</sup> + 1&nbsp;<br />= (a<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2 </sup>+ 2. a<sup>2</sup>.1 + 1<sup>2</sup> - a<sup>2</sup><br />= (a<sup>2</sup> + 1)<sup>2</sup> - a<sup>2</sup><br />=(a<sup>2 </sup>+ 1 + a)(a<sup>2</sup> + 1 - a)<br />= (a<sup>2</sup> + a + 1)(a<sup>2</sup> - a + 1)"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) a = &radic;7 + &radic;6 হলে, (a<sup>6</sup> - 1)/a<sup>3</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 54√6", "option2": "খ) 50√6", "option3": "গ) 42√6", "option4": "ঘ) 48√6", "answer": "1", "exp": "দেয়া আছে,<br />a = &radic;7 + &radic;6<br />1/a = 1/&radic;