sup>2</sup> - &radic;5x + 1 = 0<br />x<sup>2</sup> + 1 = &radic;5x&nbsp;<br />(x<sup>2</sup> + 1)/x = &radic;5x/x<br />x<sup>2</sup>/x + 1/x = &radic;5<br />x + 1/x = &radic;5<br /><br />(x - 1/x)<sup>2</sup> = (x + 1/x)<sup>2</sup> - 4x.1/x<br />(x - 1/x)<sup>2</sup> = (&radic;5)<sup>2</sup> - 4<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 5 - 4&nbsp;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 1<br />x - 1/x = 1<br /><br />x<sup>2</sup> - 1/x<sup>2</sup> = (x + 1/x)(x - 1/x)<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= &radic;5 .1&nbsp;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = &radic;5<br />"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) x<sup>2</sup> + 2xy - 2y - 1 এর একটি উৎপাদক x - 1 হলে অপরটি হবে-", "option1": "ক) (x + 2y + 2)", "option2": "খ) (x + 2y - 1)", "option3": "গ) (x - 2y + 1)", "option4": "ঘ) (x + 2y + 1)", "answer": "4", "exp": "x<sup>2</sup> + 2xy - 2y - 1<br />= x<sup>2</sup> - 1 + 2xy - 2y&nbsp;<br />= x<sup>2</sup> - 1<sup>2</sup> + 2xy - 2y&nbsp;<br />= (x + 1)(x - 1) + 2y(x - 1)<br />= (x - 1) (x + 2y + 1)"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) 1 = x - x<sup>2</sup> হলে (1/x) + x<sup>2</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 1", "option2": "খ) - 1", "option3": "গ) 0\r\n", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "3", "exp": "দেয়া আছে,<br />1 = x - x<sup>2</sup><br />x<sup>2</sup> = x - 1<br /><br />(1/x) + x<sup>2</sup> = (1/x) + x - 1<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= {1 + x(x - 1)}/x<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 1 + x<sup>2</sup> - x/x<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = 1 + x - 1 - x/x<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = 0/x<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = 0"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) 2m<sup>2</sup> - m - 15 এর উৎপাদক হবে-", "option1": "ক) (2m - 3)(m + 5)", "option2": "খ) (2m - 5)(m + 3)", "option3": "গ) (2m + 3)(m - 5)", "option4": "ঘ) (2m + 5)(m - 3)", "answer": "4", "exp": "2m<sup>2</sup> - m - 15&nbsp;<br />2m<sup>2</sup> - 6m + 5m - 15<br />= 2m(m - 3) + 5(m - 3)<br />= (2m + 5)(m - 3)"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) x<sup>2</sup> + 2x + 1 = 0 হলে x<sup>5 </sup>+ 1/x<sup>5</sup> = কত?", "option1": "ক) - 2", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 2", "option4": "ঘ) - 1", "answer": "1", "exp": "দেয়া আছে&nbsp;<br />x<sup>2</sup> + 2x + 1 = 0&nbsp;<br />x<sup>2</sup> + 2.x.1 + 1<sup>2&nbsp;</sup> = 0&nbsp;<br />(x + 1)<sup>2 </sup>= 0<br />x + 1 = 0<br />x = - 1&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br />x<sup>5</sup> + 1/x<sup>5</sup> = (- 1)<sup>5</sup> + 1/(- 1)<sup>5</sup><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= - 1 + (1/- 1)<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = - 1 - 1<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = - 2"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) a<sup>3</sup> - 6a<sup>2</sup> + 12a - 9 এর একটি উৎপাদক নিচের কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) a - 2", "option2": "খ) a + 3", "option3": "গ) a - 3", "option4": "ঘ) a + 2", "answer": "3", "exp": "ধরি&nbsp;<br />f(a) = a<sup>3</sup> - 6a<sup>2</sup> + 12a - 9&nbsp;<br />f(3) = 3<sup>3</sup> - 6 &times; 3<sup>2</sup> + 12 &times; 3&nbsp; - 9<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = 27 - 6 &times; 9 + 36 - 9<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = 27 - 54 + 36 - 9&nbsp;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = 63 - 63&nbsp;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = 0&nbsp;<br />a - 3 , f(a) এর একটি উৎপাদক।&nbsp;"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) (x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>)/xy = 5 হলে (x<sup>2</sup>/y<sup>2</sup>) + (y<sup>2</sup>/x<sup>2</sup>) এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 21", "option2": "খ) 23", "option3": "গ) 27", "option4": "ঘ) 29", "answer": "2", "exp": "দেয়া আছে&nbsp;<br />(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>)/xy = 5<br />x<sup>2</sup>/xy + y<sup>2</sup>/xy = 5<br />(x/y) + (y/x) = 5&nbsp;<br /><br />(x<sup>2</sup>/y<sup>2</sup>) + (y<sup>2</sup>/x<sup>2</sup>) = (x/y)<sup>2</sup> + (y/x)<sup>2</sup><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= {(x/y) + (y/x)}<sup>2 </sup>- 2.(x/y) . (y/x)<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 5<sup>2</sup> - 2<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 25 - 2<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 23&nbsp;"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) x<sup>3</sup> - 3x<sup>2</sup> + 4x - 4 এর সঠিক উৎপাদকে বিশ্লেষণ হবে-", "option1": "ক) (x - 2)(x<sup>2</sup> + x + 2)", "option2": "খ) (x + 2)(x<sup>2</sup> - x + 2)", "option3": "গ) (x - 2)(x<sup>2</sup> - x + 2)", "option4": "ঘ) (x - 2)(x<sup>2</sup> - x - 2)", "answer": "3", "exp": "ধরি,<br />f(x)= x<sup>3</sup> - 3x<sup>2</sup> + 4x - 4<br />f(2)= 2<sup>3</sup> - 3 .2<sup>2</sup> + 4. 2 - 4<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 8 - 12 + 8 - 4&nbsp;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 16 - 16&nbsp;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 0&nbsp;<br /><br />x<sup>3</sup> - 3x<sup>2</sup> + 4x - 4<br />= x<sup>3</sup> - 2x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp; - x<sup>2</sup> + 2x&nbsp; + 2x - 4<br />=x<sup>2</sup>(x - 2) - x (x - 2) + 2(x - 2)&nbsp;<br />= (x - 2)(x<sup>2</sup> - x + 2)"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) যদি a<sup>2 </sup>+ b<sup>2</sup> = 45 এবং ab = 18 হলে (1/a) + (1/b) এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 1", "option2": "খ) 2", "option3": "গ) 1/2", "option4": "ঘ) - 2", "answer": "3", "exp": "দেয়া আছে,<br />a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> = 45<br />ab = 18&nbsp;<br /><br />(1/a) + (1/b) = (a + b)/ab&nbsp;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= &radic;(a + b)<sup>2</sup>/ab<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= &radic;(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + 2ab)/ab<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= &radic;(45 + 2 . 18)/18<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= &radic;(45+ 36)/18<br />&nbsp; &n