x + 5y)<br />"}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) x<sup>4</sup> + x<sup>2</sup> + 1 = 5x<sup>2</sup> হলে x + 1/x এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) - √6", "option2": "খ) √6", "option3": "গ) 1/6", "option4": "ঘ) 2√6", "answer": "2", "exp": "দেয়া আছে,&nbsp;<br />x<sup>4</sup> + x<sup>2 </sup>+ 1 = 5x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;<br />x<sup>4</sup> + 1 = 5x<sup>2</sup> - x<sup>2</sup><br />x<sup>4</sup> + 1 = 4x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;<br />(x<sup>4</sup> + 1)/x<sup>2</sup> = 4x<sup>2</sup>/x<sup>2</sup><br />x<sup>4</sup>/x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup> = 4&nbsp;<br />x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2 </sup>= 4<br />(x + 1/x)<sup>2</sup> - 2x.1/x = 4<br />(x + 1/x)<sup>2</sup> - 2 = 4<br />(x + 1/x)<sup>2</sup> = 6<br />x + 1/x = &radic;6"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) 3x<sup>2</sup> - x - 14 = 0 হলে x এর মান কত হবে?", "option1": "ক) 7/3 এবং - 2", "option2": "খ) - 7/5 এবং - 2", "option3": "গ) 7/3 এবং 3", "option4": "ঘ) - 7/3 এবং 7", "answer": "1", "exp": "3x<sup>2</sup> - x - 14 = 0&nbsp;<br />3x<sup>2</sup> - 7x + 6x - 14 = 0<br />x(3x - 7) + 2(3x - 7) = 0<br />(3x - 7)(x + 2) = 0<br /><br />হয়&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;অথবা&nbsp;<br />3x - 7 = 0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;x + 2 = 0<br />3x = 7&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;x = - 2<br />x = 7/3"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) a + b + c = 5 এবং a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> = 9 হয়, ab + bc + ca = কত?", "option1": "ক) 7", "option2": "খ) 8", "option3": "গ) 9", "option4": "ঘ) 10", "answer": "2", "exp": "দেয়া আছে,<br />a + b + c = 5<br />a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> = 9<br /><br />আমরা জানি,<br />(a + b + c)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> + 2(ab + bc + ca)<br />5<sup>2</sup> = 9 + 2(ab + bc + ca)<br />25&nbsp; = 9 + 2(ab + bc + ca)<br />25 - 9 = 2(ab + bc + ca)<br />16 = 2(ab + bc + ca)<br />ab + bc + ca = 16/2<br />ab + bc + ca = 8"}, {"id": "20", "que